==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Octorok Eyeballs are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by [[Forest Octorok]]s, [[Rock Octorok]]s, [[Snow Octorok]]s, [[Treasure Octorok]]s, and [[Water Octorok]]s when killed. They can be combined with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] accepts Octorok Eyeballs as an ingredient for [[Yellow Dye]], or they can be exchanged at the [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]].

Octorok Eyeballs are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Octorok Eyeball}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
Octorok Eyeballs grant a homing quality to [[Arrow]]s when they are [[Fuse]]d together.<ref name="TotK Inventory"/>

Octorok Eyeballs are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Octorok Eyeball}}

